etting that, when enabled, remembers sort/group per list. The precondition has one list only. Not testable.\n\nHmm, what about \"Date and time\" settings ↔ first day of week? Let me check the Settings \"Date and time\" page; it might show a \"First day of week\" option, which could confirm the locale behavior or even change it to test the repeat weekday ordering! That would be a great way to verify the locale-first-day ordering: set first day of week to Monday? But is there such a setting? Tasks.org has \"Date and time\" with options like \"Show...\", \"Date format\", maybe \"First day of week\"? Let me check.\n\nLet me go back to Settings and open \"Date and time\". Press back (element 0) to Settings."}
